{"strongs": "H7347", "word": "רֵחַה", "translit": "re.cheh", "root": "רחה", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "two mill-stones", "definition": "[ רֵחַה ] noun [masculine] , only dual רֵחַיִם (hand-)mill (probably = two mill-stones ); — ׳ ר absolute, common household utensil, turned by maids, Exod 11:5 ( הָרֵחָ֑יִלם ; J ), female slaves Isa 47:1 (with טָחַן , q. v.); ׳ טָחַן בָּר Num 11:8 ( J ); וָרָ֑כֶב ׳ ר Deut 24:6 (see רכב ); ׳ קוֺל ר as sound of family life Jer 25:10 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7856')\">BDB7856</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7347')\">H7347</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7855')\">BDB7855</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7857')\">BDB7857</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>רֵחַה</bdbheb>] <b>noun [masculine]</b>, only <b>dual</b> <bdbheb>רֵחַיִם</bdbheb> (hand-)mill (probably = <highlight>two mill-stones</highlight>); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ר</bdbheb> absolute, common household utensil, turned by maids, <ref ref=\"Exod 11:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,11,5)\">Exod 11:5</ref> (<bdbheb>הָרֵחָ֑יִלם</bdbheb>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), female slaves <ref ref=\"Isa 47:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,47,1)\">Isa 47:1</ref> (with  <bdbheb><reflink>טָחַן</reflink></bdbheb>, q. v.); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>טָחַן בָּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 11:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,8)\">Num 11:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>וָרָ֑כֶב</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 24:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,24,6)\">Deut 24:6</ref> (see  <bdbheb><reflink>רכב</reflink></bdbheb>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>קוֺל ר</bdbheb> as sound of family life <ref ref=\"Jer 25:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,25,10)\">Jer 25:10</ref>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 11:5", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 11, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Isa 47:1", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 47, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Num 11:8", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 11, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Deut 24:6", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 24, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Jer 25:10", "book": "JER", "chapter": 25, "verse": 10}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["רֵחַה", "רֵחַיִם", "׳", "ר", "הָרֵחָ֑יִלם", "טָחַן", "טָחַן בָּר", "וָרָ֑כֶב", "רכב", "קוֺל ר"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["J"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB7856", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}